Tue Aug  4 13:54:04 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 2.5.2:
  * Add support for more recent versions of gpsd (gh#csete/gpredict#404)
  * Fix a second rig not connecting (gh#csete/gpredict#407)
  * Fix a data race by reloading satellites in the main thread
    (gh#csete/gpredict#409)
  * Fix some warning messages at program exit
  * Fix a compilation error on Windows (MSYS64)
- Drop the obsolete Group tag

